WEBVTT

00:02:59.759 --> 00:03:02.595
So we set up quick reaction teams

00:03:02.637 --> 00:03:06.891
to respond 24/7 to their legal needs.

00:03:06.933 --> 00:03:10.603
And this work led to the passage

00:03:10.603 --> 00:03:13.231
of an ancestral domain law
in the Philippines

00:03:13.231 --> 00:03:15.942
that set up an Indigenous
People's Commission

00:03:15.942 --> 00:03:20.029
and recognized 4 million hectares
of ancestral land claims.

00:03:20.738 --> 00:03:22.031
This --

00:03:22.031 --> 00:03:25.284
(Applause)

00:03:25.284 --> 00:03:31.040
was shared through Indonesia's legal aid
and legal rights defenders